{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28119","headline":"蜀路倦行因有所感 · 雍陶","name":"蜀路倦行因有所感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱峯碎石金牛路，过客应骑铁马行。\n白日欲斜催後乘，青云何处问前程？\n飞蝇一一皆先去，度鸟双双亦远鸣。\n蹇步不唯伤旅思，此中兼见宦途情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}